antly just uh want to see do well  and then i think the last one i'd say is  daniel because i really feel like  daniel went into the game basically had  worst case scenario happen of instantly  dislocating his shoulder and i thought  it was so cool how how well he took it  in stride and um you know how just  how much he he didn't let it let him  become a weakness in his tribe so i'm  really rooting for those three  yeah i hope that we can see daniel  bounce back from his stephanie lagrassa  moment  well zach  thank you so much for chatting today in  your short time on the show you made us  laugh  and we wish you all of the best  oh thank you so much  you
 

